        "text": "According to Arthur F. Fergenson, Esq., on behalf of Petitioner, petitioner argues it neither directed activity toward New\u202fJersey residents nor knew of its distributor\u2019s actions, so New\u202fJersey lacks jurisdiction."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
