            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Scalia, when you say \"its distributor,\" was this distributor at all controlled by the defendant?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "11f5071d15852440c54896533a34972da52628da1d4bb607bbcb625ef304ade2",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-11f5071d1585-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 21,
              "start": 21
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, you did travel to certain of the trade shows\u2014"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "11f5071d15852440c54896533a34972da52628da1d4bb607bbcb625ef304ade2",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-11f5071d1585-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 22,
              "start": 22
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Breyer, now, first, the word \"distributor\" hurts you, so I'm going to take that out\u2026"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "11f5071d15852440c54896533a34972da52628da1d4bb607bbcb625ef304ade2",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-11f5071d1585-0001-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 37,
              "start": 37
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Alito, what difference does attending some trade shows in the United States make?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice KAGAN",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "11f5071d15852440c54896533a34972da52628da1d4bb607bbcb625ef304ade2",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-11f5071d1585-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 40,
              "start": 40
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice KAGAN, isn't the point that he was selling by using large convention sites in the United States, expecting that people from other States would show up to those large convention sites?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "11f5071d15852440c54896533a34972da52628da1d4bb607bbcb625ef304ade2",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-11f5071d1585-0003-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 60,
              "start": 60
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, do you sell outright to the American company? Do you ship a product and they pay you, or they only pay you when they receive the money from their customer?"
      }
    ],
